{"name":"Still Morning","hex":"#fff8e1","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"still","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Not moving; calm.","Not effervescing; not sparkling."]},{"part":"Adverb","definitions":["Without motion.","Up to a time, as in the preceding time."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/still"},{"term":"morning","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The early part of the day, especially from midnight to noon. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}","The early part of anything."]},{"part":"Interjection","definitions":["Ellipsis of good morning."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/morning"}],"entries":[{"title":"Still","blocks":[{"text":"A still is an apparatus used to distill liquid mixtures by heating to selectively boil and then cooling to condense the vapor. A still uses the same concepts as a basic distillation apparatus, but on a much larger scale. Stills have been used to produce perfume and medicine, water for injection (WFI) for pharmaceutical use, generally to separate and purify different chemicals, and to produce distilled beverages containing ethanol."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d8/Glenfiddich_Distillery_stills.jpg/330px-Glenfiddich_Distillery_stills.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Still"},{"title":"Morning","blocks":[{"text":"Morning is either the period from sunrise to noon, or the period from midnight to noon. In the first definition it is preceded by the twilight period of dawn, and there are no exact times for when morning begins because it can vary according to one's latitude, and the hours of daytime at each time of year. However, morning strictly ends at noon, when afternoon starts."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7d/Morning%2C_just_after_sunrise%2C_Namibia.jpg/330px-Morning%2C_just_after_sunrise%2C_Namibia.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Morning"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/93/A_still_at_Mackmyra_Whisky_Distillery.jpg/500px-A_still_at_Mackmyra_Whisky_Distillery.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/93/A_still_at_Mackmyra_Whisky_Distillery.jpg/1280px-A_still_at_Mackmyra_Whisky_Distillery.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/93/A_still_at_Mackmyra_Whisky_Distillery.jpg/500px-A_still_at_Mackmyra_Whisky_Distillery.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A still at Mackmyra Whisky Distillery","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AA_still_at_Mackmyra_Whisky_Distillery.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b5/Coffey_Still.JPG/500px-Coffey_Still.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b5/Coffey_Still.JPG/1280px-Coffey_Still.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b5/Coffey_Still.JPG/500px-Coffey_Still.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Column still from Kilbeggan Distillery in County Westmeath in Ireland.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACoffey_Still.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/50/UkrainianVodkaStill.jpg/500px-UkrainianVodkaStill.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/50/UkrainianVodkaStill.jpg/1280px-UkrainianVodkaStill.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x",